===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈleiːva/}}
* {{rhymes|is|eiːva|s=2}}
* {{homophones|is|leifa}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|leyfði|leyft}}

# to [[allow]], to [[permit]], to [[give]] [[permission]] for {{+obj|is|acc<something>}}
# to [[allow]], to [[permit]], to [[give]] (someone) [[permission]] for {{+obj|is|dat<someone> + acc<something>/:að(infinitive)<to do something>}}
